msgid "Bricks Static"
msgstr "Bricks Static"

#. Plugin URI of the plugin
#: bricks-static.php
msgid "https://alanblair.co/bricks-static"
msgstr ""

#. Description of the plugin
#: bricks-static.php
msgid ""
"Generate and serve static HTML versions of Bricks-built pages for "
"performance."
msgstr ""
"Genereer en serveer statische HTML-versies van met Bricks gebouwde pagina's "
"voor betere prestaties."

#. Author of the plugin
#: bricks-static.php
msgid "Alan Blair <alan@alanblair.co>"
msgstr ""

#. Author URI of the plugin
#: bricks-static.php
msgid "https://alanblair.co"
msgstr ""

#: src/Abilities/AbilityRegistry.php:102
msgid "Inspect and drive the Bricks Static export/sync engine."
msgstr ""
"Inspecteer en bestuur de export-/synchronisatie-engine van Bricks Static."

#: src/Abilities/AbilityRegistry.php:113
msgid "Get sync status"
msgstr "Synchronisatiestatus ophalen"

#: src/Abilities/AbilityRegistry.php:114
msgid ""
"Returns whether a destination is connected, whether anything has been "
"pushed, and whether the static copy is in sync, plus the resolved sync "
"method and discovery mode."
msgstr ""
"Retourneert of een bestemming verbonden is, of er iets is gepusht en of de "
"statische kopie gesynchroniseerd is, plus de bepaalde synchronisatiemethode "
"en ontdekkingsmodus."

#: src/Abilities/AbilityRegistry.php:119
msgid "Get sync method"
msgstr "Synchronisatiemethode ophalen"

#: src/Abilities/AbilityRegistry.php:120
msgid ""
"Returns how a sync will run: discovery mode, transport, compression, server "
"target and link style."
msgstr ""
"Retourneert hoe een synchronisatie wordt uitgevoerd: ontdekkingsmodus, "
"transport, compressie, doelserver en koppelingsstijl."

#: src/Abilities/AbilityRegistry.php:125
msgid "List exportable pages"
msgstr "Exporteerbare pagina's weergeven"

#: src/Abilities/AbilityRegistry.php:126
msgid ""
"Lists published, public posts/pages with their static-export state: whether "
"each is included, whether it will actually export under the current plan, "
"and whether it is currently synced."
msgstr ""
"Toont gepubliceerde, openbare berichten/pagina's met hun statische-"
"exportstatus: of elk is opgenomen, of het daadwerkelijk wordt geëxporteerd "
"onder het huidige plan en of het momenteel gesynchroniseerd is."

#: src/Abilities/AbilityRegistry.php:131
msgid "Get page sync status"
msgstr "Synchronisatiestatus van pagina ophalen"

#: src/Abilities/AbilityRegistry.php:132
msgid ""
"For one post, returns its include/effective/synced state and per-destination"
" push state."
msgstr ""
"Retourneert voor één bericht de opgenomen/effectieve/gesynchroniseerde "
"status en de pushstatus per bestemming."

#: src/Abilities/AbilityRegistry.php:138
msgid "Check page link integrity"
msgstr "Koppelingsintegriteit van pagina controleren"

#: src/Abilities/AbilityRegistry.php:139
msgid ""
"For one post, reports internal links that point to pages NOT in the export "
"(outbound) and currently-included pages that link TO it (inbound) — the data"
" behind the manual-mode link-integrity warnings."
msgstr ""
"Rapporteert voor één bericht interne koppelingen die verwijzen naar pagina's"
" die NIET in de export staan (uitgaand) en momenteel opgenomen pagina's die "
"ERNAAR koppelen (inkomend) — de gegevens achter de "
"koppelingsintegriteitswaarschuwingen in de handmatige modus."

#: src/Abilities/AbilityRegistry.php:145
msgid "List destinations"
msgstr "Bestemmingen weergeven"

#: src/Abilities/AbilityRegistry.php:146
msgid ""
"Lists the configured deploy destinations by name, transport type and enabled"
" state. Never returns credentials."
msgstr ""
"Toont de geconfigureerde implementatiebestemmingen op naam, transporttype en"
" ingeschakelde status. Retourneert nooit inloggegevens."

#: src/Abilities/AbilityRegistry.php:151
msgid "Get sync progress"
msgstr "Synchronisatievoortgang ophalen"

#: src/Abilities/AbilityRegistry.php:152
msgid ""
"Returns the current sync job snapshot (phase, counts, totals, recent errors)"
" — useful for polling a run started elsewhere."
msgstr ""
"Retourneert de huidige momentopname van de synchronisatietaak (fase, "
"aantallen, totalen, recente fouten) — handig om een elders gestarte "
"uitvoering te volgen."

#: src/Abilities/AbilityRegistry.php:160
msgid "Set discovery mode"
msgstr "Ontdekkingsmodus instellen"

#: src/Abilities/AbilityRegistry.php:161
msgid "Sets how pages are discovered for export: \"linked\", \"all\" or \"manual\"."
msgstr ""
"Stelt in hoe pagina's worden ontdekt voor export: \"gekoppeld\", \"alle\" of"
" \"handmatig\"."

#: src/Abilities/AbilityRegistry.php:170
msgid "The discovery mode to set."
msgstr "De in te stellen ontdekkingsmodus."

#: src/Abilities/AbilityRegistry.php:178
msgid "Include or exclude a page"
msgstr "Een pagina opnemen of uitsluiten"

#: src/Abilities/AbilityRegistry.php:179
msgid ""
"In manual discovery mode, sets whether a single post is included in the "
"static export. Respects the Free page limit."
msgstr ""
"Stelt in de handmatige ontdekkingsmodus in of één bericht wordt opgenomen in"
" de statische export. Respecteert de paginalimiet van de gratis versie."

#: src/Abilities/AbilityRegistry.php:185 src/Abilities/AbilityRegistry.php:333
msgid "The post ID."
msgstr "De bericht-ID."

#: src/Abilities/AbilityRegistry.php:186
msgid "True to include, false to exclude."
msgstr "True om op te nemen, false om uit te sluiten."

#: src/Abilities/AbilityRegistry.php:193
msgid "Include multiple pages"
msgstr "Meerdere pagina's opnemen"

#: src/Abilities/AbilityRegistry.php:194
msgid ""
"In manual discovery mode, includes a batch of posts (e.g. the cascade when "
"enabling a page that links to others). Respects the Free page limit and "
"reports any skipped."
msgstr ""
"Neemt in de handmatige ontdekkingsmodus een reeks berichten op (bijv. de "
"cascade bij het inschakelen van een pagina die naar andere koppelt). "
"Respecteert de paginalimiet van de gratis versie en rapporteert eventueel "
"overgeslagen pagina's."

#: src/Abilities/AbilityRegistry.php:203
msgid "The post IDs to include."
msgstr "De op te nemen bericht-ID's."

#: src/Abilities/AbilityRegistry.php:215
msgid "Scan (dry run)"
msgstr "Scannen (proefrun)"

#: src/Abilities/AbilityRegistry.php:216
msgid ""
"Starts a check run: renders the pages and reports what would change, without"
" pushing anything to a destination."
msgstr ""
"Start een controle-uitvoering: rendert de pagina's en rapporteert wat er zou"
" wijzigen, zonder iets naar een bestemming te pushen."

#: src/Abilities/AbilityRegistry.php:222 src/Support/I18n.php:310
msgid "Sync"
msgstr "Synchroniseren"

#: src/Abilities/AbilityRegistry.php:223
msgid ""
"Starts a full sync: renders the pages and pushes the static copy to the "
"destination(s)."
msgstr ""
"Start een volledige synchronisatie: rendert de pagina's en pusht de "
"statische kopie naar de bestemming(en)."

#: src/Abilities/AbilityRegistry.php:228
msgid "Sync a single page"
msgstr "Eén pagina synchroniseren"

#: src/Abilities/AbilityRegistry.php:229
msgid ""
"Renders one page (and any new internal pages it links to) and pushes only "
"the changed files to destinations opted into single-page sync."
msgstr ""
"Rendert één pagina (en eventuele nieuwe interne pagina's waarnaar deze "
"koppelt) en pusht alleen de gewijzigde bestanden naar bestemmingen die zijn "
"aangemeld voor enkelpaginasynchronisatie."

#: src/Abilities/AbilityRegistry.php:235
msgid "The internal page URL to sync."
msgstr "De te synchroniseren interne pagina-URL."

#: src/Abilities/AbilityRegistry.php:241
msgid "Cancel sync"
msgstr "Synchronisatie annuleren"

#: src/Abilities/AbilityRegistry.php:242
msgid "Requests cancellation of the running sync job."
msgstr "Vraagt annulering aan van de lopende synchronisatietaak."

#: src/Abilities/AbilityRegistry.php:248 src/Support/I18n.php:157
msgid "Reset sync state"
msgstr "Synchronisatiestatus resetten"

#: src/Abilities/AbilityRegistry.php:249
msgid ""
"Clears the local record of what has been pushed so the next sync re-uploads "
"everything. Destructive: does not delete remote files but forces a full re-"
"upload."
msgstr ""
"Wist het lokale record van wat er is gepusht, zodat de volgende "
"synchronisatie alles opnieuw uploadt. Destructief: verwijdert geen externe "
"bestanden, maar forceert een volledige nieuwe upload."

#: src/Abilities/AbilityRegistry.php:436 src/Abilities/AbilityRegistry.php:471
#: src/Abilities/AbilityRegistry.php:579
msgid "A valid post ID is required."
msgstr "Een geldige bericht-ID is vereist."

#: src/Abilities/AbilityRegistry.php:522
msgid "Inbound links reflect the most recent scan/sync."
msgstr ""
"Inkomende koppelingen weerspiegelen de meest recente scan/synchronisatie."

#: src/Abilities/AbilityRegistry.php:582
msgid "You cannot edit this post."
msgstr "U kunt dit bericht niet bewerken."

#: src/Abilities/AbilityRegistry.php:592
msgid "Free plan page limit reached."
msgstr "Paginalimiet van het gratis plan bereikt."

#: src/Abilities/AbilityRegistry.php:660
msgid "A valid internal page URL is required."
msgstr "Een geldige interne pagina-URL is vereist."

#: src/Abilities/AbilityRegistry.php:663
msgid "No destinations are enabled for single-page sync."
msgstr ""
"Er zijn geen bestemmingen ingeschakeld voor enkelpaginasynchronisatie."

#: src/Admin/Editor.php:134
msgid "Static"
msgstr "Statisch"

#: src/Admin/Editor.php:159
msgid "In sync — open to re-sync"
msgstr "Gesynchroniseerd — open om opnieuw te synchroniseren"

#: src/Admin/Editor.php:160
msgid "Out of date — open to sync"
msgstr "Verouderd — open om te synchroniseren"

#: src/Admin/Editor.php:161
msgid "Not in the static export — open to manage"
msgstr "Niet in de statische export — open om te beheren"

#: src/Admin/Editor.php:162
msgid "Run a check or sync to see status"
msgstr "Voer een controle of synchronisatie uit om de status te zien"

#: src/Admin/Editor.php:163
msgid ""
"Saved, but over your Free limit — won’t export until you upgrade or free up "
"room"
msgstr ""
"Opgeslagen, maar boven je gratis limiet — wordt pas geëxporteerd als je "
"upgradet of ruimte vrijmaakt"

